  "body": "I think these are out of order? At [To **create an element**](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-create-element) the signature (partial) is: `document, prefix, localName`. But at the invocations I could find, the order of `prefix, localName` appears to be swapped:\n- > creating an element, given _document_, _node’s_ local name, _node’s_ namespace prefix\n- > creating an element given the context object, _localName_, null\n- > creating an element given _document_, _localName_, _prefix_\n\nP.S. I haven't figured out the build process so I haven't checked the HTML output.\n",
